{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rats rule the world and a <strong>resistance</strong> group of <strong>Cats</strong> struggle to survive. With their <strong>advanced</strong> <strong>technology</strong>, the cats send autonomous drones out to scavenge for resources, and <strong>Rescue the Cats</strong> from the hands of the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the cat robot that goes out in missions to Recue Cats that were captured by evil Rats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/68ee254948c091837c38ff8a5aced16d.poster.avif?t=1765126471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/68ee254948c091837c38ff8a5aced16d.webm?t=1765126471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/68ee254948c091837c38ff8a5aced16d.mp4?t=1765126471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every successful mission you save a Cat, and they return to the cats' camp. Some of those cats will unlock new weapons, upgrades and perks! Allowing you to become more powerful for the next mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/a148fc54198fe1ce72cfbc0ee94b9c71.poster.avif?t=1765126471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/a148fc54198fe1ce72cfbc0ee94b9c71.webm?t=1765126471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032330/extras/a148fc54198fe1ce72cfbc0ee94b9c71.mp4?t=1765126471\" type=\"video/mp4\"